message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Industrial Symbiosis and Hydrogen System Digital Twin"
abstract: >
  An interactive Digital Twin Dashboard built with Streamlit, integrating
  hydrogen production modelling, battery storage, seasonal demand simulation,
  and a Mapbox-based industrial symbiosis network visualisation. Developed as
  part of the IS2H4C – Industrial Symbiosis Hubs for Circularity initiative
  (EU Horizon Europe).
repository-code: "https://github.com/hishvm0/IS2H4C-DT"
